---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Commercial Theatre" description="Precision sound for Australia's most demanding theatre productions. Full-service audio for professional musical theatre from System Sound.">
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">Commercial Theatre</p>
      <h1>Precision sound for Australia's most <span style="color:var(--color-accent)">demanding</span> productions.</h1>
      <p>Full-service audio for professional musical theatre. System design, crew, equipment, and unwavering support from consultation to final curtain.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>System Sound specialises in delivering world-class audio for commercial musical theatre. From intimate performance spaces to touring productions, we bring 45+ years of industry experience, engineering pedigree, and a deep understanding of theatrical storytelling.</p>
        <p>With roots in Australia's golden age of commercial theatre — and decades of experience across Evita, Phantom of the Opera, Chicago, The Rocky Horror Show, Wicked, Moulin Rouge and more — we understand what productions need long before they hit the stage.</p>
        <p>Whether a production requires full system design, crew, equipment hire, or emergency technical support, we provide an end-to-end audio service that upholds the highest standards in the industry.</p>

        <h2>A Theatre-First Approach</h2>
        <p>Musical theatre has unique challenges — tight budgets, tight schedules, dynamic range, orchestral clarity, and the need to translate emotion into the back row without fatigue. System Sound approaches every show with a theatre-first mindset:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Bespoke and thoughtful system design for each venue</strong> — ensuring not only efficient bump-ins but perfect sound in every seat.</li>
          <li><strong>Unmatched communications and support</strong> from consultation to completion — we're a phone call away from creating genuine solutions to whatever challenges a production may face.</li>
          <li><strong>Long-standing relationships with key industry stakeholders</strong> — across Australia we have a rich network of support services, crew, technical services and venue contacts.</li>
          <li><strong>Perfectly maintained and world-class equipment</strong> — our cutting edge technology and industry-leading investment in the latest technology allow us to meet the needs of any production.</li>
          <li><strong>Meeting the expectations of international designers and producers</strong> — we have experience surpassing the expectations of some of the most respected and prolific design teams from Broadway and the West End.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="card-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr))">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Full Sound System Design & Consulting</h3>
          <p>We design bespoke systems for new productions, long-running shows, and redevelopments. Includes coverage prediction, system architecture, rigging design, networking, gain structure, RF planning, and FOH workflow.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Show Operation & Crew</h3>
          <p>Our team of theatre-trained engineers brings decades of experience. We can provide: FOH operators, RF technicians, A2/A3 support crew, bump-in/bump-out technical teams, touring support and swings.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Venue Upgrades & Installation</h3>
          <p>With 45+ years of experience and quality relationships with equipment suppliers — as well as being direct distributors of some of the world's best brands — we offer the ability to partner with venues in upgrading and customising their sound technology facilities.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Planning a production?</h2>
      <p>Let's talk about what you need. No obligation, just genuine expertise.</p>
      <a href="/sales-enquiry-request" class="btn btn-primary">Start the conversation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
